MODULE: UnavailableClosesBreaker
TARGET: ProbeReadOnly
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: an unavailable digest probe closes an open circuit breaker
PERTURBS: ProbeUnavailable

--- FIND
    /\ ~latch /\ phase = "idle"
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
    /\ UNCHANGED probeVars
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED guardVars
--- REPLACE
    /\ ~latch /\ phase = "idle"
    /\ open' = FALSE
    /\ UNCHANGED dataVars
    /\ UNCHANGED probeVars
    /\ UNCHANGED envVars /\ UNCHANGED <<failures, cooled, consumed>>
--- END
